title: "4-DOF Service Robotic Manipulator for Automated Beverage Preparation"
abstract: "Mechanical CAD design, Denavit-Hartenberg kinematic modeling, dual-platform Gazebo/ROS and MATLAB/Simscape simulation, and Arduino hardware trajectory execution for a desktop 4-DOF service robotic manipulator performing a five-phase tea-preparation task."
